# Normalize text to LF everywhere. This is not cosmetic: src/provenance.py hashes the
# raw bytes of src/**/*.py into every run's recorded environment, and src/predict.py
# compares that hash strictly. Without an explicit eol, Git for Windows' core.autocrlf=true
# rewrites *.py to CRLF on checkout, silently invalidating trained artifacts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.h5 binary
